WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.470
Our next guest, that ring, especially true.

2
00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:04.860
When two co-workers who had known each other for years

3
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.950
discovered something shocking

4
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.010
through a mutual friend on Facebook.

5
00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:10.420
Take a look.

6
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.340
Meet Sandi Sandrick and Allan Tucker.

7
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.980
Two friends and coworkers with quite a story to share.

8
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.390
My name is Sandi Sandrick.

9
00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:20.270
I was born in Phoenix, Arizona.

10
00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.710 line:15%
I am currently a trauma nurse

11
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:23.590 line:15%
at Banner Thunderbird Medical Center.

12
00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.920 line:15%
My name is Allen Tucker.

13
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.280
I grew up in a little town in Kansas.

14
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.130 line:15%
I am currently a trauma nurse

15
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.053 line:15%
at Banner Thunderbird Medical Center.

16
00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.120
When I was 11, my parents told me I was adopted.

17
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.140
They told me who my birth mother was

18
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.200
but they didn't have any information about my birth father.

19
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.650
Sandi and Allen are both now married with children.

20
00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:47.810
And interestingly enough, have more than that in common.

21
00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.490 line:15%
My adopted parents passed away.

22
00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:52.910 line:15%
Then my birth mother got in contact with me.

23
00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:54.380
She told me that my biological dad

24
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.060
would wanna know that I was okay.

25
00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:58.190
She just blurted his name out

26
00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.150
and said, "He would be interested to meet you."

27
00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:03.370
So, I sent him a private message on Facebook.

28
00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:04.780 line:15%
And when I looked at his friend list

29
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:08.040 line:15%
that's when I saw Allen's name.

30
00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.070 line:15%
One day I came to work.

31
00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:15.070 line:15%
I saw Sandi and she looked a little nervous.

32
00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:16.123
When I saw him.

33
00:01:16.123 --> 00:01:17.730
I told him that I needed to talk to him.

34
00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.410
I needed to ask him a question.

35
00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:23.100
She said, "How do you know this guy, Gary?"

36
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.940
And he said, "Why, how do you know Gary?"

37
00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:30.940
It was kind of this unreal moment that felt right.

38
00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:33.310
It was a moment that would change

39
00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:35.851
their lives forever.

40
00:01:35.851 --> 00:01:37.040
(audience applauding)

41
00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.640
Okay, Sandi and Allen are here now.

42
00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.802
Sandi, Allen, hi!

43
00:01:41.802 --> 00:01:42.719
Hi, Drew.

44
00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:45.650
How are you, guys?

45
00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:47.510
Good, how are you?

46
00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:51.070
Good, I'm so excited to talk about your story.

47
00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:56.070
So, you come together, you ask how, you know, Gary,

48
00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:58.664
what happens next?

49
00:01:58.664 --> 00:02:02.738
He said that he was his dad.

50
00:02:02.738 --> 00:02:03.571
(laughing)

51
00:02:03.571 --> 00:02:05.250
And I said he was my dad too.

52
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.000
What is the first sort of thing that you say

53
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.263
after that realization?

54
00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.480
Wow, that was quite a day.

55
00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:15.240 line:15%
We were busy at work.

56
00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.940 line:15%
We were doing traumas and COVID

57
00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:21.093 line:15%
and throughout the day it just kind of sunk in.

58
00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.750 line:15%
We have the same father and she's my sister.

59
00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:25.583
Yeah.

60
00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:26.847
Do you like check in and you're like,

61
00:02:26.847 --> 00:02:27.760
"Hey, me again.

62
00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:30.040
Okay, by the way, how crazy is that sibling thing?

63
00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.610
Okay, I'll see you in five."

64
00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:32.443
(laughing)

65
00:02:32.443 --> 00:02:34.760
Okay, yeah, I mean, it's just, it's so mind-blowing

66
00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:38.387
and, you know, looking back now, have you like gone,

67
00:02:38.387 --> 00:02:41.200
"Wow, look at all those similarities.

68
00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.866
Like the fact that we do the same thing."

69
00:02:43.866 --> 00:02:45.131
(man in audience laughing)

70
00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:49.930
Yeah, we've noticed that we have a lot of similarities.

71
00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:51.300
It's crazy.

72
00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.820
I'm just so glad that you guys have been brought together

73
00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:56.350
and Allen, you have other siblings, right?

74
00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.683
Sandi, have you met them?

75
00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.650 line:15%
I've talked to them on the phone one time.

76
00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.310 line:15%
But we're getting that arranged.

77
00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:05.450 line:15%
With just, work schedules and kids' schedules

78
00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.910 line:15%
and all that has been hard, but we're working on that.

79
00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.230 line:15%
Well, I have a little surprise for you both.

80
00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.840
Please meet your other brothers.

81
00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.700
Clint and Dustin are joining us now.

82
00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.693
Yay!
(audience applauding)

83
00:03:16.693 --> 00:03:17.526
Hi, guys!

84
00:03:21.161 --> 00:03:21.994
So cool.

85
00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.390
Oh, Clint and Dustin.

86
00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.460
I'm so happy to meet you guys.

87
00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:30.700
I feel like I'm in the middle of such a wonderful

88
00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:33.150
incredible family moment.

89
00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.870
Clint and Dustin, did you have something

90
00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.753
that you wanted to say to Sandi?

91
00:03:37.651 --> 00:03:40.666
Yeah, I'm just excited.

92
00:03:40.666 --> 00:03:41.499
Well, good news.

93
00:03:41.499 --> 00:03:44.410
This is a perfect example of what a family reunion

94
00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:47.830
in 2021 looks like and sounds like, and feels like.

95
00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:51.850
So we wanna ditch the Zoom and get you guys together.

96
00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:53.080
And as soon as it's safe,

97
00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:56.330
we want you to set sail aboard the Catalina Express Ferry

98
00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:58.230
to beautiful Catalina Island.

99
00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:00.210
Where you'll enjoy a five-night stay

100
00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.570
in a luxury condo at the Hamilton Cove Villas

101
00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.920
and enjoy some of the greatest beach-like cuisine

102
00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:10.510
courtesy of Love Catalina Island Tourism Authority

103
00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.128
and then you guys can-

104
00:04:13.128 --> 00:04:14.278
That's awesome.

105
00:04:14.278 --> 00:04:16.680
Thank you, that's amazing.

106
00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:17.690
I can't wait.

107
00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:18.523
Excited.

108
00:04:18.523 --> 00:04:19.760
That's exciting, yeah.

109
00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.520
Thank you, Sandi, Allen, Clint and Dustin

110
00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.670 line:15%
for sharing this with us.

111
00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:27.920 line:15%
We can't wait to check back in and hear all about it.

112
00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:31.030 line:15%
Congratulations on finding each other.

113
00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:32.305 line:15%
Thank you, Drew.

114
00:04:32.305 --> 00:04:33.166 line:15%
Thank you so much.

115
00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:35.749 line:15%
(upbeat music)

